              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "To contribute changes, make sure you read the guidelines first, then submit",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "pull-requests for your suggested changes.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Contributions are appreciated! If you see a part of the docs that can be",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "improved, submit a PR, or chat with us first on ",
