              "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Aformat"
            },
            {
              "text": " macro, and for converting from",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
