      },
      {
        "path": "collections",
        "kind": "module",
        "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/index.html",
        "docs": [
          {
            "type": "truncatedBlock",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Collection types.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Rust's standard collection library provides efficient implementations of the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "most common general purpose programming data structures. By using the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "standard implementations, it should be possible for two libraries to",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "communicate without significant data conversion.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "To get this out of the way: you should probably just use ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Vec",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/vec/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Avec%3A%3AVec"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " or ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HashMap",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/hash/map/struct.HashMap.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "These two collections cover most use cases for generic data storage and",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "processing. They are exceptionally good at doing what they do. All the other",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "collections in the standard library have specific use cases where they are",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "the optimal choice, but these cases are borderline ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "niche",
                    "style": "Emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " in comparison.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Even when ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Vec",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HashMap",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " are technically suboptimal, they're probably a",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "good enough choice to get started.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Rust's collections can be grouped into four major categories:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "Sequences: ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Vec",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/vec/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Avec%3A%3AVec"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ", ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "VecDeque",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/vec_deque/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Avec%5Fdeque%3A%3AVecDeque"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ", ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "LinkedList",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/linked_list/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Alinked%5Flist%3A%3ALinkedList"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "Maps: ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "HashMap",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/hash/map/struct.HashMap.html"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ", ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "BTreeMap",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/btree/map/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Abtree%3A%3Amap%3A%3ABTreeMap"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "Sets: ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "HashSet",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/hash/set/struct.HashSet.html"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ", ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "BTreeSet",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/btree/set/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Abtree%3A%3Aset%3A%3ABTreeSet"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "Misc: ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "BinaryHeap",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/binary_heap/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Abinary%5Fheap%3A%3ABinaryHeap"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "When Should You Use Which Collection?",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "These are fairly high-level and quick break-downs of when each collection",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "should be considered. Detailed discussions of strengths and weaknesses of",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "individual collections can be found on their own documentation pages.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Vec",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/vec/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Avec%3A%3AVec"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " when:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want to collect items up to be processed or sent elsewhere later, and",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "don't care about any properties of the actual values being stored.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a sequence of elements in a particular order, and will only be",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "appending to (or near) the end.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a stack.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a resizable array.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a heap-allocated array.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "VecDeque",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/vec_deque/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Avec%5Fdeque%3A%3AVecDeque"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " when:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Vec",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/vec/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Avec%3A%3AVec"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " that supports efficient insertion at both ends of the",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "sequence.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a queue.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a double-ended queue (deque).",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "LinkedList",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/linked_list/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Alinked%5Flist%3A%3ALinkedList"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " when:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Vec",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/vec/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Avec%3A%3AVec"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " or ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "VecDeque",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/vec_deque/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Avec%5Fdeque%3A%3AVecDeque"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " of unknown size, and can't tolerate",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "amortization.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want to efficiently split and append lists.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You are ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "absolutely",
                            "style": "Emphasis"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " certain you ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "really",
                            "style": "Emphasis"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ", ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "truly",
                            "style": "Emphasis"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ", want a doubly linked",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "list.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HashMap",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/hash/map/struct.HashMap.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " when:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want to associate arbitrary keys with an arbitrary value.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a cache.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a map, with no extra functionality.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "BTreeMap",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/btree/map/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Abtree%3A%3Amap%3A%3ABTreeMap"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " when:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a map sorted by its keys.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want to be able to get a range of entries on-demand.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You're interested in what the smallest or largest key-value pair is.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want to find the largest or smallest key that is smaller or larger",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "than something.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use the ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Set",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " variant of any of these ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Map",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "s when:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You just want to remember which keys you've seen.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "There is no meaningful value to associate with your keys.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You just want a set.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "BinaryHeap",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/collections/binary_heap/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3Acollections%3A%3Abinary%5Fheap%3A%3ABinaryHeap"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " when:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want to store a bunch of elements, but only ever want to process the",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "\"biggest\" or \"most important\" one at any given time.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "You want a priority queue.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Performance",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Choosing the right collection for the job requires an understanding of what",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "each collection is good at. Here we briefly summarize the performance of",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "different collections for certain important operations. For further details,",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "see each type's documentation, and note that the names of actual methods may",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "differ from the tables below on certain collections.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Throughout the documentation, we will adhere to the following conventions",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "for operation notation:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "The collection's size is denoted by ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "n",
                            "style": "InlineCode"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ".",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "If a second collection is involved, its size is denoted by ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "m",
                            "style": "InlineCode"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ".",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "Item indices are denoted by ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "i",
                            "style": "InlineCode"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ".",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "Operations which have an ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "amortized",
                            "style": "Emphasis"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " cost are suffixed with a ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "*",
                            "style": "InlineCode"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ".",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "Operations with an ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "expected",
                            "style": "Emphasis"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " cost are suffixed with a ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "~",
                            "style": "InlineCode"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ".",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Calling operations that add to a collection will occasionally require a",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "collection to be resized - an extra operation that takes ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "O",
                    "style": "Emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "(",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "n",
                    "style": "Emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ") time.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Amortized",
                    "style": "Emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " costs are calculated to account for the time cost of such resize",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "operations ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "over a sufficiently large series of operations",
                    "style": "Emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". An individual",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "operation may be slower or faster due to the sporadic nature of collection",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "resizing, however the average cost per operation will approach the amortized",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "cost.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Rust's collections never automatically shrink, so removal operations aren't",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "amortized.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "HashMap",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/hash/map/struct.HashMap.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " uses ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "expected",
                    "style": "Emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " costs. It is theoretically possible, though very",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "unlikely, for ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HashMap",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/hash/map/struct.HashMap.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " to experience significantly worse performance than",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "the expected cost. This is due to the probabilistic nature of hashing - i.e.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "it is possible to generate a duplicate hash given some input key that will",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "require extra computation to correct.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Section",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Cost of Collection Operations",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "table",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "spans": []
                  },
                  {
                    "spans": [
                      {
                        "text": "get(i)",
                        "style": "Plain"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "spans": [
                      {
                        "text": "insert(i)",
                        "style": "Plain"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "spans": [
                      {
                        "text": "remove(i)",
                        "style": "Plain"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "spans": [
                      {
                        "text": "append(Vec(m))",
                        "style": "Plain"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "spans": [
                      {
                        "text": "split_off(i)",
                        "style": "Plain"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
