                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/net/socket_addr/index.html?search=core%3A%3Anet%3A%3Asocket%5Faddr%3A%3ASocketAddrV6"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " are respectively IPv4 and IPv6 socket addresses",
