      {
        "path": "intrinsics",
        "kind": "module",
        "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/intrinsics/index.html",
        "docs": [
          {
            "type": "truncatedBlock",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Compiler intrinsics.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "The functions in this module are implementation details of ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "core",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and should",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "not be used outside of the standard library. We generally provide access to",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "intrinsics via stable wrapper functions. Use these instead.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "These are the imports making intrinsics available to Rust code. The actual implementations live in the compiler.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Some of these intrinsics are lowered to MIR in ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_mir_transform/src/lower_intrinsics.rs",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_mir_transform/src/lower_intrinsics.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "The remaining intrinsics are implemented for the LLVM backend in ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_codegen_ssa/src/mir/intrinsic.rs",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_codegen_ssa/src/mir/intrinsic.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "and ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_codegen_llvm/src/intrinsic.rs",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_codegen_llvm/src/intrinsic.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ",",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "and for const evaluation in ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_const_eval/src/interpret/intrinsics.rs",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_const_eval/src/interpret/intrinsics.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Const intrinsics",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "In order to make an intrinsic unstable usable at compile-time, copy the implementation from",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "https://github.com/rust-lang/miri/blob/master/src/intrinsics",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/miri/blob/master/src/intrinsics"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " to",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_const_eval/src/interpret/intrinsics.rs",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/compiler/rustc_const_eval/src/interpret/intrinsics.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "and make the intrinsic declaration below a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "const fn",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". This should be done in coordination with",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "wg-const-eval.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "If an intrinsic is supposed to be used from a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "const fn",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " with a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "rustc_const_stable",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " attribute,",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "#[rustc_intrinsic_const_stable_indirect]",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " needs to be added to the intrinsic. Such a change requires",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "T-lang approval, because it may bake a feature into the language that cannot be replicated in",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "user code without compiler support.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Volatiles",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "The volatile intrinsics provide operations intended to act on I/O",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "memory, which are guaranteed to not be reordered by the compiler",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "across other volatile intrinsics. See ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "read_volatile",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/ptr/fn.read_volatile.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "and ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "write_volatile",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/ptr/fn.write_volatile.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Atomics",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "The atomic intrinsics provide common atomic operations on machine",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "words, with multiple possible memory orderings. See the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "atomic types",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/sync/atomic/index.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " docs for details.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Unwinding",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Rust intrinsics may, in general, unwind. If an intrinsic can never unwind, add the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "#[rustc_nounwind]",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " attribute so that the compiler can make use of this fact.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "However, even for intrinsics that may unwind, rustc assumes that a Rust intrinsics will never",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "initiate a foreign (non-Rust) unwind, and thus for panic=abort we can always assume that these",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "intrinsics cannot unwind.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "level": "SingleLine"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
