              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Iterators are also composable, and it's common to chain them together to do",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "more complex forms of processing. See the ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
