              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "The three forms of iteration",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "There are three common methods which can create iterators from a collection:",
