                    "text": "fold",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "which call ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "next",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " internally. However, it is also possible to write a custom implementation of",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "methods like ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "nth",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "fold",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " if an iterator can compute them more efficiently without calling",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "next",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "for",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " loops and ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "IntoIterator",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Rust's ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "for",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " loop syntax is actually sugar for iterators. Here's a basic",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "example of ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "for",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
