                  },
                  {
                    "text": "iterator: ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "IntoIterator",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/iter/traits/collect/trait.IntoIterator.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". This trait has one method, ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "into_iter",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ",",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "which converts the thing implementing ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "IntoIterator",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/iter/traits/collect/trait.IntoIterator.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " into an iterator.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Let's take a look at that ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "for",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " loop again, and what the compiler converts",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "it into:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "codeBlock",
                "lang": "rust",
                "code": "let values = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];\n\nfor x in values {\n    println!(\"{x}\");\n}"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Rust de-sugars this into:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "codeBlock",
                "lang": "rust",
                "code": "let values = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];\n{\n    let result = match IntoIterator::into_iter(values) {\n        mut iter => loop {\n            let next;\n            match iter.next() {\n                Some(val) => next = val,\n                None => break,\n            };\n            let x = next;\n            let () = { println!(\"{x}\"); };\n        },\n    };\n    result\n}"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "First, we call ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "into_iter()",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " on the value. Then, we match on the iterator",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "that returns, calling ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "next",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " over and over until we see a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "None",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". At",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "that point, we ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "break",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " out of the loop, and we're done iterating.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "There's one more subtle bit here: the standard library contains an",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "interesting implementation of ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "IntoIterator",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/iter/traits/collect/trait.IntoIterator.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ":",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "codeBlock",
                "lang": "ignore (only-for-syntax-highlight)",
                "code": "impl<I: Iterator> IntoIterator for I\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "In other words, all ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Iterator",
