                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "perform a move on the pinned value. This is the case since the only way to access that pinned",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "value is through the pinning ",
