                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/pin/struct.Pin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " for soundness for some types, but which also want to be used by other types that",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
