                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Future",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/future/future/trait.Future.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " types that don't care about pinning. These futures can implement ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unpin",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/marker/trait.Unpin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "therefore get around the pinning related restrictions in the API, while still allowing the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "subset of ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Future",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/future/future/trait.Future.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "s which ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "do",
                    "style": "Emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " require pinning to be implemented soundly.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Note that the interaction between a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Pin<Ptr>",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/pin/struct.Pin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unpin",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/marker/trait.Unpin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is through the type of the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "pointee",
                    "style": "Strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " value, ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<Ptr as Deref>::Target",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". Whether the ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Ptr",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " type itself",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "implements ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unpin",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/marker/trait.Unpin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " does not affect the behavior of a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Pin<Ptr>",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/pin/struct.Pin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". For example, whether or not",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Box",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Fstd%2Fboxed%2Fstruct%2EBox"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unpin",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/marker/trait.Unpin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " has no effect on the behavior of ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Pin",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/pin/struct.Pin.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Box",
                    "style": "Plain",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Fstd%2Fboxed%2Fstruct%2EBox"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "<T>>",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", because",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "T",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is the type of the pointee value, not ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Box",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Fstd%2Fboxed%2Fstruct%2EBox"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". So, whether ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "T",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " implements ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unpin",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/marker/trait.Unpin.html"
                  },
