              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Using such an intrusive pattern, elements may only be added when they are pinned. If we think",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "about the consequences of adding non-pinned values to such a list, this becomes clear:",
