                  {
                    "text": " or otherwise invalidating an element's data would invalidate the pointers back to it",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "which are stored in the elements ahead and behind it. Thus, in order to soundly dereference",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "the pointers stored to the next and previous elements, we must satisfy the guarantee that",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
