                "type": "codeBlock",
                "lang": "rust",
                "code": "impl Struct {\n    fn field(self: Pin<&mut Self>) -> Pin<&mut Field> {\n        // This is okay because `field` is pinned when `self` is.\n        unsafe { self.map_unchecked_mut(|s| &mut s.field) }\n    }\n}"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Structural pinning comes with a few extra requirements:",
