                          },
                          {
                            "text": ", but the struct (and hence its fields) might have been pinned",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "before. The destructor must be written as if its argument was",
