                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3Aself"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " guarantee",
                            "style": "Plain",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3Aself"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ": once your struct is pinned, the struct's storage cannot",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "be re-used without calling the structurally-pinned fields' destructors, as well.",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "spans": [
                          {
                            "text": "This can be tricky, as witnessed by ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "VecDeque<T>",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Fstd%2Fcollections%2Fstruct%2EVecDeque"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": ": the destructor of ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "VecDeque<T>",
                            "style": "InlineCode",
                            "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Fstd%2Fcollections%2Fstruct%2EVecDeque"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " ",
                            "style": "Plain"
                          },
