              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "In the standard library, pointer types generally do not have structural pinning,",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "and thus they do not offer pinning projections. This is why ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Box<T>",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Fstd%2Fboxed%2Fstruct%2EBox"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ": ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unpin",
