                    "text": "holds for all ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "T",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". It makes sense to do this for pointer types, because moving the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
