                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/result/enum.Result.html#method.expect"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". This will panic if the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "write fails, providing a marginally useful message indicating why:",
                    "style": "Plain"
