                    "text": "inside this module in order to process the format string.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "The goal of this macro is to even further prevent intermediate allocations",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
