                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Note that these rules describe when two completely known types are ABI-compatible. When",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "considering ABI compatibility of a type declared in another crate (including the standard",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "library), consider that any type that has a private field or the ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "#[non_exhaustive]",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " attribute",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "may change its layout as a non-breaking update unless documented otherwise -- so for instance,",
